    "m_Content": "float NdotL = saturate(dot(normal, lightDir));\nfloat lightAmount = NdotL * shadowAtten;\nfloat toonStep = smoothstep(0.25, 0.75, lightAmount);\n\n// blend the shadow zone's darkness back toward lit, rather than pure black\nhalf3 finalShadowColor = lerp(litColor, shadowColor, _ShadowIntensity);\nhalf3 color = lerp(finalShadowColor, litColor, toonStep);",
